	<string name="credits_creator">Save anywhere. Organize effortlessly.\n\nA modern Android file-saving utility</string>
	<string name="credits_content1">&appname; is a simple application for saving copies of files to your phone through the file \"share\" and \"open\" functions.</string>
	<string name="credits_content2">&appname; is a fork of Phone Saver, originally developed by &author;. The original project is available at <a href="https://github.com/ScreamingHawk/phone-saver">github.com/ScreamingHawk/phone-saver</a>.</string>
